            "author": {
              "name": "Thariq",
              "handle": "trq212"
            },
            "text": "experimenting with a lil personal project: an AI-native macOS dock with custom modes (writing, building, etc.) to help me stay focused\n\nmy agent is able to customize mode behavior and add new modes, it uses jev to classify my activity + notifications in real time & act on them",
